{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "13a9b8fc7d72263bb4229c06752efb4b539fe14db5978fdeb896bb37fb1520da", "ja": "すっげー！　熱い試合になりそうだぜ♪\n連れてきてくれてありがとな{$P$}！", "zh": "太棒了！看来会是一场热血沸腾的比赛♪\n谢谢你带我来，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5058ca5d7eaf026af8401fd2363ec2248f18a49b24fe2aa80a172f11cec71b13", "ja": "喜んでもらえて良かった。\nそれにしても、昴は本当に野球が好きなんだな。", "zh": "你能高兴真是太好了。\n话虽如此，昴真的很喜欢棒球啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "d949bc746f6bdceaf1aa5718f500becad1bd4c83ad7449da927fb696bf6d5d30", "ja": "うん！　オレの家、きょうだい全員\n野球やってるからなー。", "zh": "嗯！我家兄弟姐妹全都打棒球，所以啊——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "ce6c6385588bfd17c8c77282d46f1c3245831a7f9aa7df5001288940b6377e6f", "ja": "あの頃は、プロ野球選手になるのが夢でさー。\nいつも兄ちゃん達といっしょに、練習がんばってたよ。", "zh": "那时候，我的梦想是成为职业棒球选手呢～\n一直都和哥哥们一起努力练习哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "91a8185123f7aa0b5325fc663e0379a4dff3dbaaa635fa370ba1f4d3cfbc1431", "ja": "まあ……オレには無理だって思って、\n諦めちゃったんだけどさ……。", "zh": "不过……我觉得自己肯定当不了职业棒球选手，就放弃了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1008_p", "source_sha256": "98fae607204ffd11f5ea1a0ecdc8a7a7840c4e2dafcabfebf87231b6658a9cb0", "ja": "昴……。", "zh": "昴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "4833bbb83782da3d57b573e2a9ce3e2cba8afd169d291f5d9ed3670d5b945b15", "ja": "だって、あんなにうまい兄ちゃんたちでも勝てない\n相手がいるんだぜ。それにオレ、体も小さいし……。", "zh": "因为，就连那么厉害的哥哥们，也有赢不了的对手啊。而且我的个子也小……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1010_p", "source_sha256": "be434682346b5c6a0e7cfa184914a91be885ac094926d0b86fcb2646f75b0260", "ja": "（そういえば合同レッスンの時も、昴は\n体の大きさを気にしているようだったな）", "zh": "这么说来，合练的时候，昴似乎也很在意自己的体格啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c32b3015a9b50e919cb947f9fa5411f2d123e7c20e9b0e274aea92d543e1b780", "ja": "（スポーツの世界は、フィジカルが重要な要素だ。\n男女の体格差もあるし、それを間近で感じていたのか）", "zh": "（体育界，身体素质是重要因素。男女之间也存在体格差异，昴是近距离感受到了这一点吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "07cc3f746aff6072fb6c7e82332c440f8526a411dccfdbeb1404a954daa30166", "ja": "でもさ、今度の夢は諦めないぜ。\nアイドルなら、小さくてもできるからな！　だろ？", "zh": "不过，我不会放弃下一个梦想。  \n只要是偶像，就算个子小也能做到！对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c4b043f744a125ea8fa74f3c2ff7beec12b4bd2aff40b99ed91f52783a63a79f", "ja": "もちろんだ。アイドルに体格は関係ない。\n誰でもトップになれる可能性がある。", "zh": "那是当然。做偶像和体格没有关系。\n任何人都有可能成为顶尖偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "c8ad93149e67cadf06f9acaf072c50566ffacebc7ae62b94e1861ee4d21fbc5f", "ja": "だよな！　オレ、野球選手にはなれなかったけど……\nいつかアイドルとして、ドームで歌う！", "zh": "对吧！我虽然没能成为棒球选手……  \n但总有一天，要作为偶像在巨蛋里唱歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "9882783305b0995a4af96f438f4affec12a6c32af50f8738dd241b55ee246135", "ja": "そんでこの客席を、オレのファンで\nいっぱいにしてやるぜ！", "zh": "然后，我要让这片观众席坐满我的粉丝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "c46fbff6a9ae49b2ca9fcfc10267174fa878bd9db8ebbd3841c974fc9995dd28", "ja": "……っていうのが、答えじゃダメかな？　宿題の……。\nうう、やっぱうまく言えないよ～！", "zh": "……拿这个来当答案不行吗？就是留的作业……\n呜呜，果然还是没办法说好啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6c2ca3ff1ad177edcadb0e3d3832c7c95f42a91c9383b2a90a647a1271e60637", "ja": "いや。諦めないのは、昴のいいところだ。\nガッツもあるし、なにより有言実行できる！", "zh": "不，永不放弃就是昴的优点。\n不仅有毅力，最重要的是说到就能做到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c0a99d371b4b0c370b9fef630457bb9cf9178c202be930ab5f5de4b99e353a90", "ja": "それでこそ昴だ。……とはいえ、ドームか。\nうん、最高の目標ができたな！", "zh": "这才是昴嘛。……不过，巨蛋啊。\n嗯，有了一个最棒的目标！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_133_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "0dfff2e64bb1691675777fa958de9483dd50a590459357b199561c5a8354f04a", "ja": "へへっ、だろ？", "zh": "嘿嘿，是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
